WEBVTT

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.900
<i>I don't need any kindness</i>

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.150
<i>I won't stop in any old place</i>

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:20.160
<i>Cause my wish carries on forever and ever</i>

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:25.170
<i>I won't fear anything</i>

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:31.920
<i>Without waiting for sunshine</i>

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.930
<i>Under the starry sky</i>

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:42.350
<i>I walk in the lonely night</i>

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:51.400
Ichijoji, good demonstration.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.280
Thank you.

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:57.600
Wow, Ichijoji-kun is amazing.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.600
Well, he is the king.

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:02.290
These demonstrations are great.

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:07.040
Every week, we get to see all kinds 
of magical arts performed up close.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.040
Everyone tries so earnestly.

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:12.610
Their sparkles are all 
beautiful in different ways.

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:13.300
Yeah.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:17.410
I'm so glad I got in to Hoshigei.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:19.330
Aigasaki Kohana, you're up next week.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:20.300
Huh?

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:22.820
What?! M-Me?

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:24.150
Nice, Kohana!

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.230
No, wait.

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:27.620
I'm so excited for next week.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:30.740
What kind of flower arrangement 
will you show us, Aigasaki-san?

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:32.660
I'm sure it'll be wonderful.

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:34.030
Well, actually...

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:36.970
After all, you're Aigasaki Sakura's daughter.

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:38.610
Hey, mind your manners.

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:41.920
Oh, sorry. I admire her so much,
 I wasn't thinking.

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:43.360
I-It's okay.

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:45.920
But we expect great things 
from you, Aigasaki-san.

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:46.670
Yeah.

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:48.000
I'm so excited.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.500
I can't wait.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.980
Yeah, I'm so excited.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:53.000
I-I'll do my best.

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:12.180
<b>Magic-Kyun! Renaissance</b>

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:26.970
Inspiration in an Album

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:28.970
I see.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:31.730
You're next?

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:35.800
My turn came so much sooner than I expected.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:36.970
What am I going to do?

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:38.980
I'm not as good as everyone else yet.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.690
You'll be fine, Aigasaki-san.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.240
You can do it.

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:45.370
Thanks.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:48.420
Aoi-kun, how's your calligraphy coming along?

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:53.130
Little by little, I think I'm getting 
closer to what I want to write.

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:54.250
That's great.

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:56.130
I'm happy for you.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:01.630
Anyway, Ichijoji-kun's singing was amazing.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.490
It was so beautiful.

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:05.570
I wish you could've heard it.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:08.440
I've heard him sing plenty of times.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:11.780
Oh, right. You're childhood friends.

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:12.660
Yeah.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.020
Were you in kindergarten together?

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:17.270
No, we lived near each other.

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:21.760
I wasn't expecting you to come back.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.550
And I'll be back again.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.280
The others haven't come today, either?

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.240
I try to go talk to them every day,

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.040
but I'm never able to see anyone.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.660
I'm sure I will tomorrow though.

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:33.660
You don't have to go.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:34.720
What?

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:38.100
You should focus on preparing for your 
demonstration for the time being.

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.040
What? But...

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.260
It's your first demonstration.

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:43.050
Don't underestimate it.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:45.050
Got it.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:47.550
Sounds like you, Teika.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:51.390
Good grief. Only three of you again?

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:53.940
Well, it can't be helped.

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:55.980
Let's start shaping this executive committee.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.290
Shaping it?

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.420
The principal won't shut up about it.

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:01.730
Let's begin.

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:05.460
Ichijoji, will you be the chairman?

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:06.160
Yes, sir.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.710
Then Aigasaki, you'll be the vice chairwoman.

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:09.730
Yes, sir.

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:12.840
Wait, what? I'm the vice chairwoman?

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:13.860
Yeah.

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:15.370
And Suminomiya...

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:19.410
Since your handwriting's good, 
you can be the secretary.

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:20.700
Secretary?

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.380
Secretary.

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:25.980
Ichijoji, you run the rest of the meeting.

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:26.720
Yes, sir.

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:30.600
<i>I-I'm the vice chairwoman.</i>

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:32.900
Really? That's amazing.

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:35.930
The king is chairman, and 
you're the vice chairwoman.

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.860
I-I hope it'll be okay.

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:39.730
There is bad blood between you two.

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:41.580
What? Oh, no.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:43.900
Hey, isn't that her?

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.090
She's doing the demonstration next week.

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:49.220
Oh, Aigasaki's daughter.

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:50.280
You can do it.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:53.790
Senpai, you have our support.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:56.660
We'll definitely go next week.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.780
What kind of magical arts do you use?

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:00.060
I'm so excited.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:00.660
We'll come watch.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:01.670
You can do it.

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:02.920
What?!

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:07.700
Wh-Why? Why are people I don't 
even know coming to watch?!

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.900
Transfer students are rare here,

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.680
and you're Aigasaki Sakura's daughter.

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:14.180
Of course people are expecting 
great things from you.

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:18.270
My mom was really amazing.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.810
You're realizing that now?

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:24.440
When my mom died in the accident,

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.620
I was only ten years old.

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:35.330
I sort of knew she was a famous Artista.

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:39.460
But to me, my mom was just my mom.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:44.460
My dad had been gone since
 before I could remember,

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:47.230
so it was always me and my mom.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:50.470
I loved my mom.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.180
I loved her.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:56.100
Did your mom teach you about 
flower arranging then?

00:06:56.100 --> 00:07:00.390
No, not properly. So...

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:05.730
This album my mom left to me is my teacher.

00:07:07.170 --> 00:07:11.530
It's teaching me how to arrange 
flowers like my mom.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.000
I see.

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:21.170
I'm thinking of doing this 
arrangement for the demonstration.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.970
Wow, it's so beautiful!

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:28.290
I remember how my mom's sparkles looked 
when she made this arrangement.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:34.160
So I want to make the same 
sparkles with this arrangement.

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:38.660
Come on, come on.

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.430
Right? Right? Doesn't it look good?

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.420
Come on, Monet.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.060
It stinks of carrots.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:50.190
No, wait. You've got to get 
all your essential vitamins.

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:51.600
Come on.

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:57.690
Rin Rin, your sweets are the best.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.800
Angelo, you're swiping my food?

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:01.960
But Rin Rin,

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.290
lately you've been so focused 
on feeding Monesuke

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.460
that you've only been letting 
me eat your test dishes.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:09.550
Monesuke? What kind of name is that?

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:12.430
As his older cousin, Monesuke—

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:14.130
I mean, Monet...

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:15.010
Hey!

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.680
Anjo-senpai, I found you!

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:18.770
You're not getting away this time.

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:20.120
It's Kanato.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:21.780
Tomorrow we'll settle the score.

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:23.920
Who cares about that?

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:24.890
Settle the score?

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:25.830
In basketball.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:26.690
Really?

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:31.940
Tomorrow, I'll be able to write 
vivacious and powerful characters.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.520
He hasn't changed.

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:38.440
He hasn't changed.

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:41.290
I've never seen Suminomiya-senpai before.

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:42.700
He really exists.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.030
Vivacious.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.460
Shinra-niisan, what is it?

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:53.950
<i>"What is it?" Don't give me that.</i>

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:56.820
<i>Teika-kun, you haven't been calling.</i>

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:58.260
I'm sorry.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:01.470
<i>I heard your demonstration went fabulously.</i>

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:03.380
<i>Keep up the good work.</i>

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:04.540
Yes, brother.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.480
<i>I'm handing the phone to Masana-niisan.</i>

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.160
<i>Teika.</i>

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:10.210
Yes, brother.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:15.410
<i>I heard the Aigasaki girl was chosen to be 
on the Hoshinomori Summer Festival committee.</i>

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:16.470
Yes.

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:19.240
<i>Show them just how much stronger 
you are during the Art Session.</i>

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:23.800
<i>Doing so will allow you to make your 
professional debut as an Artista.</i>

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:29.460
<i>It will also further improve the 
Ichijoji family's reputation.</i>

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.830
<i>I expect great things from you.</i>

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:33.130
Yes, brother.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:41.140
<i>The same arrangement as my mom's.</i>

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:52.400
<i>The same arrangement as my mom's.</i>

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:58.040
Kohana!

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:00.410
You can do it!

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:01.640
Yeah!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.170
Yeah, I'll be fine.

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:11.410
All I need to finish it is this flower.

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:16.020
Thank you.

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:21.870
I've never seen them in person before.

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:23.060
They're so beautiful.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:25.030
And they smell so nice.

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:30.650
<i>Yeah. I know...</i>

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:32.260
<i>I know I can do it!</i>

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:56.760
<i>I know... I know I can do it.</i>

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.260
I'm finished.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:09.980
What?

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:18.180
What? Is that it?

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:20.300
It's sort of lacking.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.550
But something's different.

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:22.660
It's good, but...

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:23.460
It's not glowing.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:25.090
Yeah, I guess it's pretty.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.050
Why not?

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:27.490
That's it? I was looking forward to this, too.

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:32.940
I see. You're weaker to 
pressure than you look.

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.490
You'd better get that fixed 
before your next turn.

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:39.150
The pressure?

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:41.720
I see. So that's what it was.

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:49.520
You still couldn't produce the Light of Arte?

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:51.120
No.

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:55.140
If you're trying to become an 
Artista by attending Hoshigei,

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:58.470
you must always be able to produce the light.

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:00.190
Work harder.

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:03.370
If you're still unable to produce the light,

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:06.580
I'll have you quit the 
Hoshi Festival committee.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:07.700
What?

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:09.800
No...

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:13.170
For you.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:14.870
Magic-Kyun.

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:18.290
Magic-Kyun.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:19.660
Renaissance.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:22.640
No...

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:24.050
It's only natural.

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:26.640
If you can't produce the Light of Arte,

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.060
it's not really a magical art.

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.060
You won't be able to participate 
in the Art Session.

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:35.240
That flower arrangement you made 
earlier was truly unimpressive.

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:36.810
How rude.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:39.690
I modeled that after an arrangement 
my mother made years ago.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:41.720
I see.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.170
No wonder it was out of your league.

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:48.930
I can't believe you're her daughter.

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:51.240
I feel sorry for Aigasaki Sakura.

00:12:52.590 --> 00:12:54.280
You don't understand.

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:57.000
Someone like you...

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:02.590
Someone like you who can do everything 
so easily wouldn't understand!

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:09.160
We'll talk once you've learned 
to produce the Light of Arte.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:15.730
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:19.360
That wasn't because of the pressure.

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.770
No, but if I hadn't said something,

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:25.060
the situation would've gotten out of control.

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:26.240
You're right.

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:30.610
Did you allow her to transfer

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:32.740
because she's the daughter 
of Aigasaki Sakura?

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:35.250
No.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:40.380
It was because I recognized the 
potential for excellence inside her.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:44.630
But I'm not sure those talents will blossom.

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:48.260
Isn't that how the magical arts work?

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:51.940
We can help her,

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:54.100
but we can't teach her.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.970
She has to find the path on her own.

00:13:57.820 --> 00:13:58.770
Yes.

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:12.970
Aigasaki.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:15.880
Todo-sensei.

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:20.540
Sakura-san was a truly an unparalleled genius.

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:25.930
But she also worked harder than anyone else.

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:30.370
The traditional Japanese room where she worked

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.270
is in the Hoshi Festival House.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:35.140
My mom?

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:56.290
If you can't produce the Light of Arte,

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.300
it's not really a magical art.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:02.570
That flower arrangement you made 
earlier was truly unimpressive.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:09.150
Maybe I can't do it.

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:13.970
I wanted to be like my mom, but...

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:19.910
I don't even know...

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:25.060
...what to do anymore.

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:28.580
Aoi-kun.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.740
I saw your shoes outside.

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:32.500
Oh, right.

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.310
It's so bright.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:39.620
Yeah.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.380
I still...

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:50.080
I still haven't written 
what I want to write yet.

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:53.390
I don't know what it will 
take to write it, either.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:55.960
But I'll keep on writing.

00:15:57.380 --> 00:16:00.890
The next thing I write might be it.

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:03.620
Here.

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:08.650
<b>Anchovy & Vegetable Juice
Cream Puff</b>

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:08.650
An anchovy and vegetable juice cream puff?

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:10.510
It's good.

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:11.760
Thanks.

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:18.440
Aigasaki-san?

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:21.660
It's so good!

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:24.900
I'm glad.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:32.030
I really liked the flower arrangement 
you made the other day.

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:36.960
I could feel you cheering me on.

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:37.890
It was...

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:43.020
It was an arrangement only you could make.

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:45.730
Only me?

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:53.320
Teika, you came.

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:57.620
<i>Only me.</i>

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:01.330
<i>It was an arrangement only you could make.</i>

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:04.200
<i>No wonder it was out of your league.</i>

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:06.210
What?

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:09.710
<i>Was Ichijoji-kun trying 
to say the same thing?</i>

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:13.210
<i>Was he trying to encourage me, too?</i>

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.400
An arrangement only I can make.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:23.220
Not my mom, but me.

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:26.610
You can do it.

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:28.190
I know you can do it, Kohana.

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:30.120
Mom.

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:35.700
Kohana, making flower 
arrangements is a human instinct.

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:40.740
Since ancient times, people have made 
flower arrangements to make others happy,

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:46.210
to encourage each other, 
and cheer each other up.

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.210
I'm the same way.

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:50.880
Whenever I make flower arrangements,

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.710
I imagine the people who 
will view the arrangement.

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:58.970
The people who will see my arrangement are...

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:09.850
I have so many things I want to tell them.

00:18:12.340 --> 00:18:13.860
I'm so glad I got into Hoshigei

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:19.460
and get to see their sparkles every day.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:22.370
The day I first arrived at Hoshigei,

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:25.620
I was so excited.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.630
I'm excited for the Hoshi Festival,

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:33.630
and I want to get to know them better.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:38.510
I can't make sparkles like the others yet,

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:42.510
but I'll keep on trying.

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:51.900
My dream is to someday 
make sparkles like my mom.

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:54.210
That's how I feel.

00:19:04.890 --> 00:19:07.840
<i>And I want to express my feelings to everyone!</i>

00:19:43.810 --> 00:19:45.830
Kohana, you did it!

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:09.910
She truly is her daughter.

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:20.530
They're warm.

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:24.530
What a strange girl.

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:28.900
Does the Ichijoji family 
name weigh heavily on you?

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:30.290
What are you talking about?

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:33.000
Sometimes you seem to be in pain.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:33.790
Don't be absurd.

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:36.330
Everything's coming along nicely.

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:39.800
I will become the Artista Prince.

00:20:41.230 --> 00:20:42.200
But...

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:47.540
I...

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:54.810
I prefer the way you used to sing.

00:23:25.520 --> 00:23:28.090
Shall we dance, my little flower?

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:30.300
Come on. Take my hand.

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:34.080
We'll bewitch the world with 
our pas de deux of love.

00:23:34.080 --> 00:23:36.190
Next time on Magic-Kyun! Renaissance:

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Dancing on the Moonlight</b>

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:38.220
"Dancing on the Moonlight."

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:39.980
Magic-Kyun for you!
